+# Python web app
+
+A small starter app built with Flask.
+
+## Run locally
+
+```sh
+python -m venv .venv
+source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\\Scripts\\activate
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+python app.py
+```
+
+Open <http://127.0.0.1:5000>. The `/health` endpoint returns a small JSON health check.
